What is SOFTWARE (MIT License)
------------------------------

All JavaScript in `html/assets/*.js`, the local-server helper scripts
`serve.command` and `stop.command`, and any future scripts or code added to
this project by its contributors ("the software").

What is CONTENT (CC BY-SA 4.0)
------------------------------

Everything that is not software: the teaching text and page content in
`html/*.html`, the Bangla translations, the original practice questions
(chapter quizzes, exercises, and mock exams) and their answer explanations,
the glossary, the cheat sheet, the advice digest, and the markdown documents
in `mock-exams/`, `practice/`, and `syllabus/` ("the content").


NOTICE — NO ISTQB MATERIAL IS INCLUDED OR LICENSED HERE
-------------------------------------------------------

This project contains and licenses NO material owned by ISTQB or its member
boards. Official ISTQB sample-exam questions, answer keys, syllabus excerpts
beyond short attributed factual quotes, and any other ISTQB copyrighted
material are deliberately NOT embedded in this project; the
`html/official-samples.html` page only links to official sources. Nothing in
this license grants any right to use ISTQB-owned material. "ISTQB", "CTFL",
and related names and logos are trademarks of their respective owners and are
used here only to refer descriptively to the certification being studied for.


